@startuml
' SET09803 DevOps Coursework - Requirement 18 Use Case Diagram

left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

actor "Political Scientist" as PolScientist
rectangle "Database System" as DB << System >>

rectangle "World Population Reporting System" {
    usecase "Produce All Capital Cities in a Continent Report" as UseCase18
    usecase "Validate Continent" as UseCaseValidate
    usecase "Query Capital City Data" as UseCaseQuery
    usecase "Sort by Population" as UseCaseSort
    usecase "Display Error Message" as UseCaseError
}

' Primary Actor Interaction
PolScientist --> UseCase18

' Sub-task dependencies (Includes)
UseCase18 .> UseCaseValidate : <<include>>
UseCase18 .> UseCaseQuery : <<include>>
UseCase18 .> UseCaseSort : <<include>>

' System Actor Interaction
UseCaseQuery --> DB

' Failure Extensions
UseCaseValidate <.. UseCaseError : <<extend>>\n(Continent not\nrecognised)
UseCaseQuery <.. UseCaseError : <<extend>>\n(Database Connection\nFailure)

note bottom of UseCaseError
  Triggered if the input is invalid or the MySQL
  database is unreachable or data is missing
end note

@enduml